description 1 is identified by "http://example.org/analysis/description/1".

description 1 is a legal rule.

description 1 has the label "Article 26 – Central database".

description 1 is established in "https://data.europa.eu/eli/dl/proc/2025/941/cod/doc/com/COM_2025_941/FINAL/eng/art_26".

description 1 involves the process establish a central database.

description 1 produces item 1 action.

description 1 has the description "ESMA shall establish and maintain a central database providing access to the authorities involved in or concerned by the designation process of EU systems and the registration process of third-country systems, as well as the system operators.".


description 10 is identified by "http://example.org/analysis/description/10".

description 10 is a legal rule.

description 10 has the label "Article 16 – Withdrawal of registration".

description 10 is established in "https://data.europa.eu/eli/dl/proc/2025/941/cod/doc/com/COM_2025_941/FINAL/eng/art_16".

description 10 has the digital dimension data.

description 10 has the digital dimension digital solutions.

description 10 involves the process notify.

description 10 produces item 10 action.

description 10 references data relevant for withdrawal of registration.

description 10 has the description "Where the registering authority withdraws the registration, it shall notify the system operator as well as ESMA, EBA, the ESCB and other registering authorities, as applicable, of the decision.".


description 11 is identified by "http://example.org/analysis/description/11".

description 11 is a legal rule.

description 11 has the label "Article 22 – Insolvency proceedings".

description 11 is established in "https://data.europa.eu/eli/dl/proc/2025/941/cod/doc/com/COM_2025_941/FINAL/eng/art_22".

description 11 has the digital dimension data.

description 11 has the digital dimension digital solutions.

description 11 involves the process notify.

description 11 produces item 11 action.

description 11 references data regarding insolvency proceedings.

description 11 has the description "The competent authority shall immediately notify via the central database about insolvency proceedings ESMA, the ECB/ESCB, EBA, the European Systemic Risk Board and other Member States in writing.".


description 3 is identified by "http://example.org/analysis/description/3".

description 3 is a legal rule.

description 3 has the label "Article 6 – Notifications of systems".

description 3 is established in "https://data.europa.eu/eli/dl/proc/2025/941/cod/doc/com/COM_2025_941/FINAL/eng/art_6".

description 3 has the digital dimension data.

description 3 has the digital dimension digital solutions.

description 3 involves the process notify.

description 3 produces item 3 action.

description 3 has the description "A competent authority shall notify ESMA where it has designated a system through the central database. The competent authority shall notify ESMA and any other concerned authorities through the central database of changes in relation to the designation of the system.".


description 4 is identified by "http://example.org/analysis/description/4".

description 4 is a legal rule.

description 4 has the label "Article 8 – Duties of a system operator of a designated system".

description 4 is established in "https://data.europa.eu/eli/dl/proc/2025/941/cod/doc/com/COM_2025_941/FINAL/eng/art_8".

description 4 has the digital dimension data.

description 4 has the digital dimension digital solutions.

description 4 involves the process notify.

description 4 produces item 4 action.

description 4 has the description "The system operator shall notify the competent authority, via the central database of relevant changes to the information provided in the application.".


description 5 is identified by "http://example.org/analysis/description/5".

description 5 is a legal rule.

description 5 has the label "Article 9 – withdrawal of designation".

description 5 is established in "https://data.europa.eu/eli/dl/proc/2025/941/cod/doc/com/COM_2025_941/FINAL/eng/art_9".

description 5 has the digital dimension data.

description 5 has the digital dimension digital solutions.

description 5 involves the process notify.

description 5 produces item 5 action.

description 5 references data relevant for withdrawal of designation.

description 5 has the description "Where a competent authority takes a decision to withdraw the designation of a system, the decision shall take effect throughout the Union and the competent authority shall inform the system operator, the national competent authority, ESMA, EBA and the ESCB via the central database.".


description 6 is identified by "http://example.org/analysis/description/6".

description 6 is a legal rule.

description 6 has the label "Article 10 – competent authority".

description 6 is established in "https://data.europa.eu/eli/dl/proc/2025/941/cod/doc/com/COM_2025_941/FINAL/eng/art_10".

description 6 has the digital dimension data.

description 6 has the digital dimension digital solutions.

description 6 involves the process notify.

description 6 produces item 6 action.

description 6 has the description "Member States shall notify, via the central database, the competent authorities and the registration authorities to ESMA.".


description 7 is identified by "http://example.org/analysis/description/7".

description 7 is a legal rule.

description 7 has the label "Article 11 – Exchange of information".

description 7 is established in "https://data.europa.eu/eli/dl/proc/2025/941/cod/doc/com/COM_2025_941/FINAL/eng/art_11".

description 7 has the digital dimension data.

description 7 has the digital dimension digital solutions.

description 7 has the digital dimension process automation.

description 7 involves the process notify.

description 7 produces item 7 action.

description 7 has the description "Designating authorities, registering authorities, national competent authorities, competent authorities referred to in Article 22(2), ESMA, EBA or the ESCB, shall share whatever information that is requested for carrying out their respective duties under this Regulation without undue delay".


description 9 is identified by "http://example.org/analysis/description/9".

description 9 is a legal rule.

description 9 has the label "Article 15 – Notification of registered systems".

description 9 is established in "https://data.europa.eu/eli/dl/proc/2025/941/cod/doc/com/COM_2025_941/FINAL/eng/art_15".

description 9 has the digital dimension data.

description 9 has the digital dimension digital solutions.

description 9 involves the process notify.

description 9 produces item 9 action.

description 9 has the description "After taking a decision on registration of a system, each registering authority shall notify the applicant third-country system operator, ESMA, EBA, the ESCB and the other registering authorities, as applicable of its decision.".


